# Line endings: LF everywhere, on every OS.
# Why: the generators (tokens-to-dart, sync-log-vocabulary) write LF and the gate
# compares bytes; core.autocrlf=true on Windows checked files out as CRLF and
# failed two guards for no real difference (docs/32_STUDY/reports/06-tooling-ci.md).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.xlsx binary
*.skill binary
*.jar binary
